Author: Ilkay Gül <igul@Mac.localdomain>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 02:54:10 2026 +0100

    viogpu3d: F96 every mode in 60 and 120 Hz [skip ci]
    
    Target and monitor modes are offered at the host EDID rate (60 Hz,
    preferred/default) and at 120 Hz; CommitVidPn records the pinned target
    mode's VSyncFreq and the flip thread's vsync timer follows it. Off with
    Refresh120=0 in the adapter key. Measured with crosvm pacing r6: window
    drag 115-117 fps, 96-97% of intervals within 8.3+-2 ms; back to 60 Hz
    unchanged (drag 59 fps, 98% within 17+-4 ms).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

